<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Oxygen 6-mth net up 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Oxygen 6-mth net up 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  34.46   vs	  34.04</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 49.8    vs	  49.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		   194.66   vs	 161.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    42.52   vs	  37.80</p>
<p>    Minorities		    --    vs	    --</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 8.1    vs	   7.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysian Oxygen Bhd is a maker of industrial and medical gases.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
